WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:04.625
The four heroes put away their weapons.

2
00:00:04.626 --> 00:00:08.415
The fight was over.

3
00:00:08.416 --> 00:00:12.238
Some ferrets still lay on the floor.

4
00:00:12.239 --> 00:00:15.511
"I'll tie them up," said Rat.

5
00:00:15.512 --> 00:00:18.550
Badger wiped his face.

6
00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:23.334
"Mole," he said, "check the ferrets outside."

7
00:00:23.335 --> 00:00:26.700
Then Badger turned to Toad.

8
00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:31.910
"Let's pick up the broken dishes," he said.

9
00:00:31.911 --> 00:00:37.690
"Oh, my best china!" said Toad sadly.

10
00:00:37.691 --> 00:00:40.642
"Cheer up, Toad," said Rat.

11
00:00:40.643 --> 00:00:43.149
"It was a good fight!"

12
00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:48.525
"Our battle will be remembered!" said Badger.

13
00:00:48.526 --> 00:00:53.967
Toad, Badger, and Rat swept up the broken plates.

14
00:00:53.968 --> 00:00:57.944
"I'm hungry," said Rat, looking around.

15
00:00:57.945 --> 00:01:01.400
"Let's see if the weasels left any food."

16
00:01:01.401 --> 00:01:05.596
Toad and Rat went into the kitchen.

17
00:01:05.597 --> 00:01:10.217
Mole walked in carrying a pile of guns.

18
00:01:10.218 --> 00:01:12.834
"It's all over," said Mole.

19
00:01:12.835 --> 00:01:15.500
"The ferrets outside ran away.

20
00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:18.542
They dropped their guns on the grass."

21
00:01:18.543 --> 00:01:22.994
"Ha!" laughed Badger.

22
00:01:22.995 --> 00:01:25.260
"They were scared.

23
00:01:25.261 --> 00:01:30.473
They feared gangs of toads, and rats in boats."

24
00:01:30.474 --> 00:01:35.585
"And a hundred badgers too!" added Mole.

25
00:01:35.586 --> 00:01:40.386
"There is one more thing to do," said Badger.

26
00:01:40.387 --> 00:01:42.752
"What?" asked Mole.

27
00:01:42.753 --> 00:01:47.090
"Take these ferrets upstairs," said Badger.

28
00:01:47.091 --> 00:01:50.337
"They can make up the beds for us."

29
00:01:50.338 --> 00:01:55.665
"Let us go!" the ferrets howled.

30
00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:59.306
"After all that fighting," said Badger,

31
00:01:59.307 --> 00:02:02.528
"we'll need a good night's sleep!"

32
00:02:02.529 --> 00:02:05.806
"March!" yelled Mole.

33
00:02:05.807 --> 00:02:11.502
And the ferrets went up the stairs.

